               <div class="faq-q-and-a__accordion-content-wrapper">
                  <div itemprop="text"><p>Air treatment appliances are designed to help improve indoor comfort and air quality. This includes air purifiers, fans, heaters and humidifiers that help manage temperature, airflow, air quality and humidity levels. Dyson offers a range of air treatment solutions that combine multiple functions within a single machine. </p>
