            <div class="faq-q-and-a__accordion-content accordion__content" id="b954bc2f33f644b2a75249a554707143" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
               <div class="faq-q-and-a__accordion-content-wrapper">
                  <div itemprop="text"><p>An air purifier is designed to capture airborne particles and help improve indoor air quality. Dyson air purifiers, such as the Dyson Purifier Big&#43;Quiet Formaldehyde Purifying fan, draw air through advanced filtration systems before projecting purified air back into the room. Machines like the Dyson Purifier Hot&#43;Cool HP2 De-NOx Purifying fan heater and Dyson Pure Hot&#43;Cool™ HP00 Purifying fan heater combine air purification with additional comfort features such as heating or cooling. </p>
