               <div class="faq-q-and-a__accordion-content-wrapper">
                  <div itemprop="text"><p>A fan is designed primarily to circulate air and create a cooling effect, while an air purifier is designed to filter airborne particles before projecting cleaner air back into the room. Some Dyson air treatment machines combine purification, cooling and heating in a single device, helping reduce the need for multiple appliances. </p>
